#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:151
msgid "Returns one link page as JSON (profile, design, blocks with ids) and its modified time. Custom HTML and custom CSS are summarized, not returned. Use the block ids in operations for preview-operations and apply-operations (or propose-changes), and pass modified as expected_modified."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:165
msgid "Operations in the CrazyLinks format (see get-editing-guide), applied in order."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:183
msgid "Get the CrazyLinks editing guide"
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:184
msgid "Call this before writing operations for a CrazyLinks link page: returns the block types and their props, the operations format with examples, the rules and the recommended workflow. Optional input id (a link page id) also returns that page's current content and modified time."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:208
msgid "Preview operations on a link page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:209
msgid "Checks operations against a link page without saving anything. Input: id and operations (format in get-editing-guide). Returns valid, the errors to fix, warnings, a plain-English change_list and the resulting page; invalid operations come back as valid false, so fix them and preview again before apply-operations."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:237
msgid "Apply operations to a link page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:238
msgid "Validates operations like preview-operations and saves them to the link page, creating a revision shown as \"AI (external)\" in the page history. Input: id, operations, optional summary (for the history), expected_modified (modified from get-page; refused if the page changed since) and idempotency_key (a retry with the same key returns the first result). Use after a valid preview. If the page requires confirmation, nothing is saved and the change waits in the editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:247
msgid "One sentence describing the change, shown in the page history."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:251
msgid "The modified value returned by get-page. If the page changed since, nothing is saved and a conflict error is returned."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:256
msgid "Any unique string for this change. Repeating a call with the same key within 30 minutes returns the first result without applying again."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:287
msgid "Propose changes to a link page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:288
msgid "Turns an instruction into validated operations and a preview of the resulting page, without saving. Either give \"instruction\" (the site's own AI writes the operations) or \"operations\" in the CrazyLinks ops format (schemas/ai-ops.v1.json: add_block, update_block, move_block, remove_block, set_design, set_profile). Returns a proposal_id for apply-changes; proposals expire after 30 minutes. If \"questions\" is non-empty, answer them and propose again with questions_answers."
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:328
msgid "Apply proposed changes"
msgstr ""

#: src/Ai/Abilities.php:329
msgid "Applies a proposal from propose-changes and saves the page through the normal save path, creating a revision that appears in the page history as \"AI (external)\". Applying the same proposal twice has no further effect. Pages can require changes from external agents to be confirmed in the editor instead."
msgstr ""

